/* ========================================================
   DEDICATED GLOBAL TAMIL FONT SYSTEM FOR BABY JEESHIKA
   Complete OpenType v2 (tml2 & taml) Support with Zero CORS / File Protocol Dependency
   Includes Multiple Bold Headline Options for Ceremony Titles:
   - JeeshikaMarutham: Ultra-Bold Punchy Monumental Title Font
   - JeeshikaKurinji: Elegant Decorative Calligraphic Title Font
   - JeeshikaMullai: Wide Festive Regal Title Font
   - JeeshikaNilavu: Contemporary Soft-Curved Rounded Title Font
   - JeeshikaTamil / JeeshikaEzhil: Traditional Classic Serif Font
   ======================================================== */

@font-face {
  font-family: 'JeeshikaTamil';
  src: url('data:font/truetype;charset=utf-8;base64,') format('truetype');
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

